{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>8 月 17 日是印尼獨立 81 周年，多個在港印尼人團體今（23日）在銅鑼灣維園舉行慶祝活動，吸引眾多外傭參與，穿著傳統民俗服飾載歌載舞。同場有多個機構提供中醫、按摩、手工藝攤位，主辦單位指外傭作為香港家庭的照顧者，冀藉活動關懷他們的身心健康。</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_9355-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_9394-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_9466-1024x704.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_9470-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_9522-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_9578-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_9643-1024x739.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_9676-1024x696.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_9730-1024x643.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CW_9762-1024x703.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Payme-500x237.png\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-23T10:38:07.997754+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":11,"source":"The Collective HK","fallback":"none"}}